        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Retention&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;VictoriaMetrics, VictoriaLogs, VictoriaTraces and Pyroscope keep 7 days. ClickHouse keeps the same traces and logs for 90 days (7 days on the hot volume, then the RustFS cold volume), which is where a question older than a week goes. Edge access logs reach ClickHouse only: the VictoriaLogs pipeline drops them. Every arrow into Grafana is a query, one datasource per backend." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
